## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- MACD: `iMACD(NULL,PERIOD_H1,12,26,9,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,i)` for bars i=1..20
- Peak detection: scan bars 1..20 for local max (hist[i] > hist[i-1] && hist[i] > hist[i+1]); store first peak `macd_peak_1_val` and its bar index
- Current peak: detect on bar[1] — new local peak if `hist[1] > hist[2] && hist[1] > hist[0]`
- Divergence: `macd_peak_2_val < macd_peak_1_val && iHigh(H1,1) > iHigh(H1, peak1_bar)` 
- Stoch: `iStochastic(NULL,PERIOD_H1,9,3,3,MODE_SMA,STO_LOWHIGH,MODE_MAIN,1)` — K line
- Overbought exit: `K[2] > 80 && K[1] < 80`
- Window: divergence and Stoch exit within 2 bars: `abs(divergence_bar - stoch_exit_bar) <= 2`
- P3 sweeps: MACD (8/12/19, 17/26/39, 9), Stoch (5/9/14, K/D), divergence lookback (10/20/30)

